SENTENCE : s.

Brian    : np                   = 'Brian'.
Conor    : np                   = 'Conor'.
Dara     : np                   = 'Dara'.
Fiona    : np                   = 'Fiona'.
Ronan    : np                   = 'Ronan'.
Seamus   : np                   = 'Seamus'.
Tara     : np                   = 'Tara'.

Animal   : n                    = lambda x : x in animals.
Badger   : n                    = lambda x : kind[x] == 'badger'.
Cat      : n                    = lambda x : kind[x] == 'cat'.
Dog      : n                    = lambda x : kind[x] == 'dog'.
Mouse    : n                    = lambda x : kind[x] == 'mouse'.

Sleeps   : np \ s               = lambda x : x in sleep.
Chases   : np \ (s / np)        = lambda x : lambda y : (x,y) in chase.
Fears    : np \ (s / np)        = lambda x : lambda y : (x,y) in fear.

Is       : np \ (s / adj)       = lambda x : lambda p : p(x).
Hungry   : adj                  = lambda x : x in hungry.
Hungry   : n / n                = lambda p : lambda x : p(x) and x in hungry.
Grey     : adj                  = lambda x : x in grey.
Grey     : n / n                = lambda p : lambda x : p(x) and x in grey.

Someone  : s / (np \ s)         = lambda p : any (p(x) for x in animals).
Someone  : (s / np) \ s         = lambda p : any (p(x) for x in animals).
Every    : (s / (np \ s)) / n   = lambda q : lambda p : all (p(x) for x in animals if q(x)).
Every    : ((s / np) \ s) / n   = lambda q : lambda p : all (p(x) for x in animals if q(x)).
A        : (s / (np \ s)) / n   = lambda q : lambda p : any (p(x) and q(x) for x in animals).
A        : ((s / np) \ s) / n   = lambda q : lambda p : any (p(x) and q(x) for x in animals).

And      : s \ (s / s)          = lambda x : lambda y : x and y.
And      : adj \ (adj / adj)    = lambda p : lambda q : lambda x : p(x) and q(x).
